NOTICE

This work derives from the "postfix" package for pfSense software in
Unofficial-pfSense-packages by Marcello Coutinho:

    https://github.com/marcelloc/Unofficial-pfSense-packages

The original is Apache-2.0 licensed and its copyright notice is retained above,
as Section 4 of the License requires.

As required by Section 4(b), the changes made to the original are:

  - An installer (install.sh) was added. It obtains the postfix binary from
    FreeBSD's official package repository rather than from a third-party pkg
    repository, and registers the package on pfSense 2.9.

  - Documentation (README.md, LEEME.md, docs/VERIFY.md) was added.

The package's own PHP and XML files are carried unmodified: they were verified
to load and parse correctly on pfSense 2.9 with PHP 8.5.

Postfix itself is not distributed with this package. It is installed from
FreeBSD's package repository at install time and is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2, or the IBM Public License 1.0.
